      <p class="description">
        

        Twenty-seven people took part in a 2-hour public standstill/walking performance at Deichman Bjørvika (Oslo main library), 2025-10-09; 16 of them wore Equivital EQ02 LifeMonitor chest sensors and are the participants in this dataset. Each vest logged 2-lead ECG (256 Hz), tri-axial accelerometer (256 Hz), thoracic respiration (25.6 Hz),...
      </p>

