      <p class="description">
        

        These are audio recordings taken by an Eclipse Soundscapes (ES) Data Collector during the week of the April 08, 2024 Total Solar Eclipse. 

It was decided to include only raw, unprocessed audio data files in each site-specific Zenodo record.  
This decision was so that any researcher can independently verify, reproduce, and extend the analysis...
      </p>

